CCs stuck at AI pilot stage: Dell-Zinnov report", "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/technology/nearly-70-of-indias-gccs-stuck-at-ai-pilot-stage-dell-zinnov-report/articleshow/134432876.cms", "image": "https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-134432876,imgsize-109716.cms", "summary": "The report, titled 'India GCCs 2030: From Capability Centers to Agentic Transformation Engines', noted that while ambition remains high, approximately 55% of routine GCC work is currently exposed to AI-led automation, necessitating that nearly 60% of the workf", "label": "GCC & Enterprise Technology"}, "_movers": [{"title": "Hub names Forchelli executive VP, Mills sales chief", "url": "https://www.businessinsurance.com/hub-names-forchelli-executive-vp-mills-sales-chief/", "type": "Appointed", "kind": "appointment", "source": "Business Insurance", "date": "23 Sep", "ts": 1790175549.0}, {"title": "Ocean Spray names chief supply chain officer", "url": "https://www.supplychaindive.com/news/ocean-spray-names-chief-supply-chain-officer/830937/", "type": "Appointed", "kind": "appointment", "source": "Www", "date": "23 Sep", "ts": 1790162280.0}, {"title": "Lars Karstrup to step down – what does it mean for Singapore’s PIL?", "url": "https://theloadstar.com/lars-karstrup-to-step-down-what-does-it-mean-for-singapores-pil/", "type": "Steps down", "kind": "exit", "source": "Theloadstar", "date": "23 Sep", "ts": 1790161578.0}, {"title": "People Moves: Reath Named Marsh Risk US Real Estate, Hospitality Practice Head; Sternadori to Lead AXIS US Excess Casualty, Flaherty CUO Wholesale Casualty", "url": "https://www.insurancejournal.com/news/national/2026/09/23/886423.htm", "type": "Appointed", "kind": "appointment", "source": "Insurance Journal", "date": "23 Sep", "ts": 1790142154.0}], "_record": {"quotes": [{"quote": "We've packed a lot of technology with this little guy … So, if you're not wearing glasses, this is going to be by far the fastest way to talk to your Muse and to show it what's going on around you.", "leader": "Mark Zuckerberg", "company": "Meta", "source": "CNBC", "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/23/mark-zuckerberg-1299-meta-vr-glasses-ai-agent.html", "date": "24 Sep", "ts": 1790215010.0}, {"quote": "We have built a new kind of VR device that delivers the same magical feeling of presence and immersion, high-resolution displays and views of the world around you in a form factor that is a pair of glasses for the first time", "leader": "Mark Zuckerberg", "company": "Meta", "source": "CNBC", "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/23/mark-zuckerberg-1299-meta-vr-glasses-ai-agent.html", "date": "24 Sep", "ts": 1790215010.0}, {"quote": "One of the great promises of e-commerce since the earliest days of the industry has been that it can save you money and time … Personal agents are going to continue delivering on that promise for a new generation of shoppers, and they're going to help them discover products they …", "leader": "Alexandr Wang", "company": "Meta", "source": "CNBC", "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/23/metas-standoff-with-amazon-over-muse-comes-ahead-of-meta-connect.html", "date": "24 Sep", "ts": 1790214323.0}, {"quote": "In our history, there have been times where countries who compete and don't always like each other very much still come together for shared interests and the collective good in the face of a powerful new technology … We believe this must be one of those times", "leader": "Sam Altman", "company": "OpenAI", "source": "CNBC", "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/23/altman-amodei-un-ai-safety.html", "date": "23 Sep", "ts": 1790195360.0}, {"quote": "Beating companies in a competitive race is not a reason to make rash decisions … We have unilaterally slowed down in the past. We will do so in the future.", "leader": "Sam Altman", "company": "OpenAI", "source": "CNBC", "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/23/altman-amodei-un-ai-safety.html", "date": "23 Sep", "ts": 1790195360.0}, {"quote": "With electricity, we could power everything … With the internet, you can find anything. And now, with artificial intelligence as an infrastructure layer across the planet, we can know everything and do anything.", "leader": "Jensen Huang", "company": "NVIDIA", "source": "NVIDIA Blog", "url": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/jensen-huang-dreamforce/", "date": "15 Sep", "ts": 1789511074.0}, {"quote": "Safety is paramount in a lot of ways. It’s job one … However, safety is an engineering problem. We’re developing computing systems after all … If you build a product or a service and you’re not confident in its functionality, capability or safety, then don’t release it.", "leader": "Jensen Huang", "company": "NVIDIA", "source": "NVIDIA Blog", "url": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/jensen-huang-dreamforce/", "date": "15 Sep", "ts": 1789511074.0}], "window_days": 14, "leaders": [{"name": "Sam Altman", "company": "OpenAI"}, {"name": "Greg Brockman", "company": "OpenAI"}, {"name": "Dario Amodei", "company": "Anthropic"}, {"name": "Daniela Amodei", "company": "Anthropic"}, {"name": "Mike Krieger", "company": "Anthropic"}, {"name": "Sundar Pichai", "company": "Google"}, {"name": "Demis Hassabis", "company": "Google DeepMind"}, {"name": "Koray Kavukcuoglu", "company": "Google"}, {"name": "Jensen Huang", "company": "NVIDIA"}, {"name": "Lisa Su", "company": "AMD"}, {"name": "Satya Nadella", "company": "Microsoft"}, {"name": "Mustafa Suleyman", "company": "Microsoft AI"}, {"name": "Kevin Scott", "company": "Microsoft"}, {"name": "Mark Zuckerberg", "company": "Meta"}, {"name": "Alexandr Wang", "company": "Meta"}, {"name": "Liang Wenfeng", "company": "DeepSeek"}, {"name": "Yang Zhilin", "company": "Moonshot AI (Kimi)"}, {"name": "Arthur Mensch", "company": "Mistral AI"}, {"name": "Aravind Srinivas", "company": "Perplexity"}], "generated": "2026-09-24T06:56+00:00"}, "_pulse": [{"name": "Christopher J. Swift", "role": "CEO", "title": "St. John’s to Honor Hartford CEO Swift as Insurance Leader of Year", "url": "https